<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Declaration Form</title>
    <!--[if gte mso 9]>
    <xml>
        <w:WordDocument>
            <w:View>Print</w:View>
            <w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom>
            <w:DoNotOptimizeForBrowser/>
        </w:WordDocument>
    </xml>
    <![endif]-->
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; }
        .header { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 2px solid #000; padding-bottom: 10px; }
        .logo { width: 100px; }
        .title-box { background-color: #5b9bd5; color: white; text-align: center; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #000; }
        .content { margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .form-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 20px; }
        .form-table td { border: 1px solid #000; padding: 10px; vertical-align: top; }
        .label-cell { width: 30%; font-weight: bold; height: 40px; }
        .seal-cell { height: 150px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; margin-top: 50px; font-size: 0.8rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h2 style="margin:0;">ADEEB GROUP PROCUREMENT PROCEDURE</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="title-box">
        DECLARATION FORM
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>I, THE UNDERSIGNED CERTIFY THAT THE INFORMATION FURNISHED IN THIS VENDOR PRE-QUALIFICATION QUESTIONNAIRE IS CORRECT, AND THAT I HAVE LEGAL CAPACITY TO SIGN ON BEHALF OF STATED COMPANY (ATTACH PROOF OF LEGAL CAPACITY IN FORMS OF POWER OF ATTORNEY, CERTIFIED DOA OR ANY LEGALLY ACCEPTABLE DOCUMENT).</p>
        <p>I ACCEPT THAT ADEEB GROUP MAY ACT AGAINST SHOULD THIS DECLARATION PROVED TO BE FALSE.</p>
    </div>

    <table class="form-table">
        <tr>
            <td class="label-cell">NAME OF UNDERSIGNED</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="label-cell">POSITION</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="label-cell">DATE</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td class="label-cell seal-cell">APPROVED COMPANY SEAL</td>
            <td></td>
        </tr>
    </table>

    <div class="footer">
        Page 1 of 1
    </div>
</body>
</html>
